{"id":"n56098-2-7","stage":1,"title":"낚시 · 钓鱼","scene":"休闲与爱好","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56098-2-7-1","ko":"취미가 뭐니?","zh":"你的爱好是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"취미가","meaning":"爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","explanation":"취미：爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"취미","audio":"/audio/fce0e79fcf68c195df88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72149","senseId":"1","lemma":"취미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"취미가","audio":"/audio/a0b912ba5fcf1bba700a.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐니?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐니","audio":"/audio/c123f71de2e0a9dffdf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fce0e79fcf68c195","term":"취미","zh":"爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","audio":"/audio/fce0e79fcf68c195df88.mp3","entryId":"72149","definition":"喜欢而为了乐趣做的事。","pronunciation":["취ː미"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/a3b72e8a46bdae390ad2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56098-2-7-2","ko":"주말에 아버지를 따라 강에서 낚시를 하는 거예요.","zh":"周末我会跟着父亲去河边钓鱼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에","audio":"/audio/ff068f34f21f5a2dea38.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지를","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지를","audio":"/audio/c36fbe9284137ce6c1a1.mp3"}},{"text":"따라","meaning":"跟着父亲","explanation":"아버지를 따라 表示跟着父亲一起去河边，并非只是模仿他的动作。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"1","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따라","audio":"/audio/b3d3c74efc47a457e176.mp3"}},{"text":"강에서","meaning":"江，河","explanation":"강：江，河；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"강","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30203","senseId":"1","lemma":"강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강에서","audio":"/audio/aa65bc5936d8ea94779b.mp3"}},{"text":"낚시를","meaning":"钓鱼","explanation":"낚시：钓鱼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"낚시","audio":"/audio/997b7b3d44815df9d683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56098","senseId":"2","lemma":"낚시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낚시를","audio":"/audio/7be53bd71329fd2ecab0.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"钓鱼","explanation":"낚시를 하다 是“钓鱼”；하는 거예요 回答前面“爱好是什么”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"就是这件事","explanation":"-는 거예요 在这里把“周末跟父亲去钓鱼”作为爱好的说明。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"3ad4e3c6c1e70dee","term":"따르다","zh":"跟着、跟随","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3","entryId":"64547","definition":"在别人后面跟着走；本句指跟父亲去河边。","pronunciation":["따르다"]},{"id":"d90ed2084b71f17c","term":"강","zh":"江，河","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3","entryId":"30203","definition":"又宽又长、最后流入大海的水流。","pronunciation":["강"]},{"id":"997b7b3d44815df9","term":"낚시","zh":"钓鱼","audio":"/audio/997b7b3d44815df9d683.mp3","entryId":"56098","definition":"用钓具捕鱼。","pronunciation":["낙씨"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"钓鱼（낚시를 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"与 낚시 连用，表示进行钓鱼活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"这件事（-는 거예요）","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"指前述行为；这里把周末钓鱼说成自己的爱好。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/632ca5174b2aeb0c8bd7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.898,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56098","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.5514,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["周末我会跟着父亲去河边钓鱼。","这幅画上还写着诗呢。","你的爱好是什么？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["周末我会跟着父亲去河边钓鱼。","你的爱好是什么？","这幅画上还写着诗呢。"],"answer":0}]}
